    "content": {
      "question_html": "<p>A car of mass 1200 kg moving at 15 m s<sup>−1</sup> collides with a stationary car of mass 800 kg. The two cars move off together.</p>\n<div class=\"q-part\"><span class=\"q-part__label\">(a)</span><div class=\"q-part__body\">Calculate the velocity of the cars immediately after the collision.</div><span class=\"q-marks\">(2)</span></div>\n<div class=\"q-part\"><span class=\"q-part__label\">(b)</span><div class=\"q-part__body\">Calculate the kinetic energy transferred to other forms in the collision.</div><span class=\"q-marks\">(3)</span></div>",
      "question_image_url": null,
      "mark_scheme_html": "<div class=\"q-part\"><span class=\"q-part__label\">(a)</span><div class=\"q-part__body\">Conservation of momentum: 1200 × 15 = 2000 × v</div><span class=\"ms-codes\">(1)</span></div>\n<div class=\"q-line\"><div class=\"q-line__text\">v = 9.0 m s<sup>−1</sup></div><span class=\"ms-codes\">(1)</span></div>\n<div class=\"q-part\"><span class=\"q-part__label\">(b)</span><div class=\"q-part__body\">Initial E<sub>k</sub> = <span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"frac__n\">1</span><span class=\"frac__d\">2</span></span> × 1200 × 15<sup>2</sup> = 135 000 J</div><span class=\"ms-codes\">(1)</span></div>\n<div class=\"q-line\"><div class=\"q-line__text\">Final E<sub>k</sub> = <span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"frac__n\">1</span><span class=\"frac__d\">2</span></span> × 2000 × 9.0<sup>2</sup> = 81 000 J</div><span class=\"ms-codes\">(1)</span></div>\n<div class=\"q-line\"><div class=\"q-line__text\">Energy transferred = 54 000 J</div><span class=\"ms-codes\">(1)</span></div>",
      "mark_scheme_image_url": null
    }
  },
