    "content": {
      "question_html": "<p>A satellite orbits the Earth at a height of 400 km above the surface.</p>\n<p>Mass of Earth = 5.97 × 10<sup>24</sup> kg, radius of Earth = 6.37 × 10<sup>6</sup> m, G = 6.67 × 10<sup>−11</sup> N m<sup>2</sup> kg<sup>−2</sup>.</p>\n<div class=\"q-part\"><span class=\"q-part__label\">(a)</span><div class=\"q-part__body\">Show that the orbital speed of the satellite is about 7.7 km s<sup>−1</sup>.</div><span class=\"q-marks\">(3)</span></div>\n<div class=\"q-part\"><span class=\"q-part__label\">(b)</span><div class=\"q-part__body\">Calculate the orbital period of the satellite.</div><span class=\"q-marks\">(2)</span></div>\n<div class=\"q-part\"><span class=\"q-part__label\">(c)</span><div class=\"q-part__body\">State how the period would differ for a satellite in a higher orbit.</div><span class=\"q-marks\">(1)</span></div>",
      "question_image_url": null,
      "mark_scheme_html": "<div class=\"q-part\"><span class=\"q-part__label\">(a)</span><div class=\"q-part__body\">Equates gravitational force and centripetal force: <span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"frac__n\">GMm</span><span class=\"frac__d\">r<sup>2</sup></span></span> = <span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"frac__n\">mv<sup>2</sup></span><span class=\"frac__d\">r</span></span></div><span class=\"ms-codes\">(1)</span></div>\n<div class=\"q-line\"><div class=\"q-line__text\">r = 6.37 × 10<sup>6</sup> + 4.0 × 10<sup>5</sup> = 6.77 × 10<sup>6</sup> m</div><span class=\"ms-codes\">(1)</span></div>\n<div class=\"q-line\"><div class=\"q-line__text\">v = √(<span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"frac__n\">GM</span><span class=\"frac__d\">r</span></span>) = 7670 m s<sup>−1</sup></div><span class=\"ms-codes\">(1)</span></div>\n<div class=\"q-part\"><span class=\"q-part__label\">(b)</span><div class=\"q-part__body\">T = <span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"frac__n\">2πr</span><span class=\"frac__d\">v</span></span></div><span class=\"ms-codes\">(1)</span></div>\n<div class=\"q-line\"><div class=\"q-line__text\">T = 5500 s (about 92 minutes)</div><span class=\"ms-codes\">(1)</span></div>\n<div class=\"q-part\"><span class=\"q-part__label\">(c)</span><div class=\"q-part__body\">The period would be longer</div><span class=\"ms-codes\">(1)</span></div>",
      "mark_scheme_image_url": null
    }
  },
