    "content": {
      "question_html": "<p>A steel wire of length 2.0 m and cross-sectional area 5.0 × 10<sup>−7</sup> m<sup>2</sup> extends by 1.0 mm when a force of 50 N is applied.</p>\n<div class=\"q-part\"><span class=\"q-part__label\">(a)</span><div class=\"q-part__body\">Calculate the stress in the wire.</div><span class=\"q-marks\">(1)</span></div>\n<div class=\"q-part\"><span class=\"q-part__label\">(b)</span><div class=\"q-part__body\">Calculate the strain.</div><span class=\"q-marks\">(1)</span></div>\n<div class=\"q-part\"><span class=\"q-part__label\">(c)</span><div class=\"q-part__body\">Calculate the Young modulus of steel.</div><span class=\"q-marks\">(2)</span></div>",
      "question_image_url": null,
      "mark_scheme_html": "<div class=\"q-part\"><span class=\"q-part__label\">(a)</span><div class=\"q-part__body\">Stress = <span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"frac__n\">50</span><span class=\"frac__d\">5.0 × 10<sup>−7</sup></span></span> = 1.0 × 10<sup>8</sup> Pa</div><span class=\"ms-codes\">(1)</span></div>\n<div class=\"q-part\"><span class=\"q-part__label\">(b)</span><div class=\"q-part__body\">Strain = <span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"frac__n\">1.0 × 10<sup>−3</sup></span><span class=\"frac__d\">2.0</span></span> = 5.0 × 10<sup>−4</sup></div><span class=\"ms-codes\">(1)</span></div>\n<div class=\"q-part\"><span class=\"q-part__label\">(c)</span><div class=\"q-part__body\">Young modulus = stress ÷ strain</div><span class=\"ms-codes\">(1)</span></div>\n<div class=\"q-line\"><div class=\"q-line__text\">= 2.0 × 10<sup>11</sup> Pa</div><span class=\"ms-codes\">(1)</span></div>",
      "mark_scheme_image_url": null
    }
  },
