    "content": {
      "question_html": "<p>Light of wavelength 590 nm is incident normally on a diffraction grating with 300 lines per mm.</p>\n<div class=\"q-part\"><span class=\"q-part__label\">(a)</span><div class=\"q-part__body\">Calculate the angle at which the second-order maximum is observed.</div><span class=\"q-marks\">(3)</span></div>\n<div class=\"q-part\"><span class=\"q-part__label\">(b)</span><div class=\"q-part__body\">Determine the highest order of maximum that can be observed.</div><span class=\"q-marks\">(2)</span></div>",
      "question_image_url": null,
      "mark_scheme_html": "<div class=\"q-part\"><span class=\"q-part__label\">(a)</span><div class=\"q-part__body\">d = <span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"frac__n\">1 × 10<sup>−3</sup></span><span class=\"frac__d\">300</span></span> = 3.33 × 10<sup>−6</sup> m</div><span class=\"ms-codes\">(1)</span></div>\n<div class=\"q-line\"><div class=\"q-line__text\">Use of nλ = d sin θ with n = 2</div><span class=\"ms-codes\">(1)</span></div>\n<div class=\"q-line\"><div class=\"q-line__text\">θ = 20.7°</div><span class=\"ms-codes\">(1)</span></div>\n<div class=\"q-part\"><span class=\"q-part__label\">(b)</span><div class=\"q-part__body\">n is largest when sin θ = 1: n = <span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"frac__n\">d</span><span class=\"frac__d\">λ</span></span> = 5.6</div><span class=\"ms-codes\">(1)</span></div>\n<div class=\"q-line\"><div class=\"q-line__text\">Highest order = 5</div><span class=\"ms-codes\">(1)</span></div>",
      "mark_scheme_image_url": null
    }
  },
