      "question_html": "<p>A mass of 0.25 kg attached to a spring of stiffness 40 N m<sup>−1</sup> oscillates with simple harmonic motion of amplitude 5.0 cm.</p>\n<div class=\"q-part\"><span class=\"q-part__label\">(a)</span><div class=\"q-part__body\">Calculate the period of the oscillation.</div><span class=\"q-marks\">(2)</span></div>\n<div class=\"q-part\"><span class=\"q-part__label\">(b)</span><div class=\"q-part__body\">Calculate the maximum speed of the mass.</div><span class=\"q-marks\">(2)</span></div>\n<div class=\"q-part\"><span class=\"q-part__label\">(c)</span><div class=\"q-part__body\">Calculate the maximum acceleration of the mass.</div><span class=\"q-marks\">(1)</span></div>\n<div class=\"q-part\"><span class=\"q-part__label\">(d)</span><div class=\"q-part__body\">State the position of the mass when its kinetic energy is greatest.</div><span class=\"q-marks\">(1)</span></div>",
      "question_image_url": null,
      "mark_scheme_html": "<div class=\"q-part\"><span class=\"q-part__label\">(a)</span><div class=\"q-part__body\">T = 2π√(<span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"frac__n\">m</span><span class=\"frac__d\">k</span></span>)</div><span class=\"ms-codes\">(1)</span></div>\n<div class=\"q-line\"><div class=\"q-line__text\">T = 0.50 s</div><span class=\"ms-codes\">(1)</span></div>\n<div class=\"q-part\"><span class=\"q-part__label\">(b)</span><div class=\"q-part__body\">ω = 12.6 rad s<sup>−1</sup>; v<sub>max</sub> = ωA</div><span class=\"ms-codes\">(1)</span></div>\n<div class=\"q-line\"><div class=\"q-line__text\">= 0.63 m s<sup>−1</sup></div><span class=\"ms-codes\">(1)</span></div>\n<div class=\"q-part\"><span class=\"q-part__label\">(c)</span><div class=\"q-part__body\">a<sub>max</sub> = ω<sup>2</sup> A = 8.0 m s<sup>−2</sup></div><span class=\"ms-codes\">(1)</span></div>\n<div class=\"q-part\"><span class=\"q-part__label\">(d)</span><div class=\"q-part__body\">At the equilibrium position</div><span class=\"ms-codes\">(1)</span></div>",
      "mark_scheme_image_url": null
    }
